      "writtenOn": "2024-08-28T05:00:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These changes are not needed. The context for a domain-manager includes all roles in the implied roles hierarchy, which includes \"reader\".\n\nA domain-manager would already be allowed because GRANTS_DOMAIN_READER evaluates to true for domain-manager as well as domain-member.",
